  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Uncanny Gateway</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Any (instill) talent</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> While a creature in possession of an instilled liquid you created is within your line of effect, you may spend a swift action to allow the creature to immediately draw and consume the instilled liquid as an immediate action.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may take this feat a second time, in which case the creature may draw and consume the instilled liquid as a free action that can be taken outside their turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
